he ad group must start no earlier than a future campaign start and end no later than the campaign end (400 otherwise). Without &#x60;endDate&#x60; it ends with the campaign. - Reddit Ads, campaign without a campaign budget: send &#x60;budgetAmount&#x60;/&#x60;budgetType&#x60; for the new ad group (400 without them). Bid, conversion event and pixel work as on a new campaign. - Reddit Ads under campaign budget optimization: the ad group takes the campaign&#39;s bid, goal type, optimization event and pixel and has no budget of its own. &#x60;budgetAmount&#x60;/&#x60;budgetType&#x60;, bid fields, or another conversion event or pixel return 400, as does an &#x60;endDate&#x60; when the campaign has no end date. - Reddit Ads errors: a campaign of another ad account returns 404, a Reddit Max campaign 422. </value>
